OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1786722499
OL,3,CRestoring species and habitats 'could
OL,4,Ctake years' following wildfire
OL,6,FAlmost eighteen months on from one of
OL,7,FScotland's largest wildfires,
OL,8,Fenvironment experts say it will take
OL,9,Fmany years to reestablish some of the
OL,10,Fspecies lost in the blaze.
OL,12,FIn April 2025 a large wildfire - which
OL,13,Fcovered an area more than double the
OL,14,Fsize of Carlisle - took four days to
OL,15,Fbe put out, with Forestry and Land
OL,16,FScotland using three helicopters to
OL,17,Fwater bomb the area and stop the fire
OL,18,Ffrom spreading.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/6
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,324,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1786722499
OL,3,CRestoring species and habitats 'could
OL,4,Ctake years' following wildfire
OL,6,FThe team says that it cannot be
OL,7,Fcertain how the fire started, but says
OL,8,Fit is highly likely that it was
OL,9,Fsparked by a campfire.
OL,11,FSpeaking about the long term impacts,
OL,12,FJohn Dougan, the regional manager at
OL,13,FForestry and Land Scotland said: "We
OL,14,Fhave a really important juniper
OL,15,Fwoodland area, it's a native tree
OL,16,Fassociated with very high hill areas.
OL,18,F"We had around four and a thousand of
OL,19,Fthose trees and unfortunately all but
OL,20,Fsix have been killed.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/6
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,324,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1786722499
OL,3,CRestoring species and habitats 'could
OL,4,Ctake years' following wildfire
OL,6,F"In a superficial way the area has
OL,7,Fgreened up again, but if you look in
OL,8,Fmore detail, heather for example has
OL,9,Fbeen really badly damaged and
OL,10,Fdestroyed and that will take years to
OL,11,Frecover."
OL,13,FAilidh Reid from Forestry and Land
OL,14,FScotland added: "It will take many
OL,15,Fyears to understand the impact the
OL,16,Ffire has had.
OL,18,F"One of the species we aren't sure is
OL,19,Fstill present or not is hawker
OL,20,Fdragonfly.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/6
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,324,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1786722499
OL,3,CRestoring species and habitats 'could
OL,4,Ctake years' following wildfire
OL,6,F"One of the species that is hardest
OL,7,Fhit is reptiles, such as adders,
OL,8,Fbecause they will either will try and
OL,9,Fescape the area or dig deep into the
OL,10,Fground, and fire can sometimes bury
OL,11,Fquite deep into peat soil and burn for
OL,12,Fweeks, months or years, so a lot of
OL,13,Fmortality rates are higher with
OL,14,Freptiles than they are with more
OL,15,Fmobile species."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/6
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
