FL,324,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1786722499
OL,3,CRestoring species and habitats 'could
OL,4,Ctake years' following wildfire
OL,6,FThis summer has seen extreme heat and
OL,7,Fdry weather, and a warning has been
OL,8,Fissued across parts of the country,
OL,9,Fincluding Southern Scotland, due to
OL,10,Fthe 'very high' risk of wildfires this
OL,11,Fweek.
OL,13,FAnd further north, that warning is a
OL,14,Fstark reality, with fire crews still
OL,15,Ftackling a blaze in the Cairngorms
OL,16,Ffour weeks after it started.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/6
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
